    "introHtml": "<p>The complete Welding L1 review: 170 items across 12 module tests at 70% — processes, electrodes, symbols, safety, defects, and positions.</p><p>All content in this guide is original review material organized by the published NCCER Welding Level 1 module list. Numbers given here are the verified facts this program teaches. No exam fees are stated anywhere in this program.</p>",
